              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Arabic and English capability."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " Translating English keywords into Arabic word for word rarely works. The best agencies adapt content to local dialects, cultural context, and precise search intent in both languages, so your message resonates and earns trust."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
