            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "strong",
              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Transparent reporting."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " You should see impressions, clicks, rankings, and real business outcomes in plain language, on a set schedule. Clear dashboards and honest commentary beat vanity metrics every time."
