              "attributes": {},
              "variant": null,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A clear pricing model."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " The best agencies explain exactly what a monthly retainer or project fee covers, with no hidden add-ons. Saudi SEO retainers commonly run from SAR 3,000 to SAR 25,000 per month depending on scope, so ask what sits inside your tier."
